  "body_html": "<p>Tonight, as I was chatting with my friend Kremena about serial killers and dentists, a very important question appeared in my mind. Only you can help me solve it.</p>\n<p>Imagine that you must listen to Justin Bieber and Morbid Angel in a row. Would you prefer to listen to Justin Bieber first and then to Morbid Angel or to listen to Morbid Angel and then to Justin Bieber?</p>\n<p>IT IS EXTREMELY IMPORTANT.</p>\n<p>Thanx for your support.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone\" height=\"400\" src=\"http://ryanseacrest.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/09/Justin-Bieber-Debuts-New-Video-for-_U-Smile__600_400.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/4GuqB1BQVr4\" width=\"560\"></iframe></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/07/versus-hand.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1088\" height=\"263\" src=\"http://www.flowersinthebarrelofagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/07/versus-hand.jpg\" title=\"versus-hand\" width=\"400\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone\" height=\"432\" src=\"http://userserve-ak.last.fm/serve/_/37499977/Morbid+Angel+morbidangel.jpg\" width=\"442\"/></p>\n<p><iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/l0eZ6vPKXG8\" width=\"560\"></iframe></p>\n<p> </p>\n\n\n<p> </p>\n<p>Yes, these are the only two options.</p>",
